    "path": "/",
    "type": "hidden-source-content",
    "text": "Sarah H.\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t“I was amazed at how simple it was to sell my diamond ring at Cash4Gold and Diamond. The evaluation process was quick, and I received a fair price. Highly recommended!”\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tMichael R.\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t“I was hesitant about selling my gold necklace, but Cash4Gold and Diamond made me feel comfortable and explained everything clearly. I left feeling satisfied with the transaction.”\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tJohn D.\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t“I’ve sold several watches to Cash4Gold and Diamond, and each time I’m impressed by their professionalism and fair pricing. They make the process easy and stress-free.”"
  },
